invariant: INV-33
file: webpki.c
catches: webpki_chain_test
reason: the walk reports one entry more than it read, so the pins may
  name a certificate after the one an anchor verified, which the walk
  never checked. bin/webpki_chain_test's path rows object.

--- old
            out->path_entries = (uint8_t)read;
--- new
            out->path_entries = (uint8_t)(read + 1);
